  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Castillo de la Playa – Luxury Coastal Retreat<br><br>Experience the ultimate Gulf Coast getaway at Castillo de la Playa, a spacious three-story home in Dune Allen Beach. Perfect for large families, friends, or group vacations, this luxurious retreat offers two master suites, five additional bedrooms, and five bathrooms, comfortably sleeping up to 17 guests. Take in stunning Gulf, beach, and dune lake views from the expansive covered balconies, unwind by the private pool and spa, or stroll just a minute to Dune Allen Beach with convenient parking and amenities nearby.<br><br>Designed for comfort and gatherings, this home features an open-concept layout, a chef's kitchen with high-end appliances, and plenty of indoor and outdoor living space. Relax on the outdoor patio, enjoy the poolside lounge, or host meals at the grill while listening to the built-in Bluetooth speaker. 1st and 3rd-floor laundry rooms make extended stays easy, and parking is available for up to four cars.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>1st Floor:<br>- King Suite 1 (Sleeps 2): King bed, Smart TV, private porch, en suite with double vanities and walk-in shower<br>- Guest Bedroom 1 (Sleeps 3): Queen bed, Twin bed, Smart TV<br>- Guest Bedroom 2 (Sleeps 4): Two Twin-over-Twin bunk beds, Smart TV<br>- Shared Bathroom: Double vanities, walk-in shower<br><br>2nd Floor:<br>- Optional Guest Bedroom 3 (Sleeps 2): Trundle/daybed, Smart TV, access to half bath<br><br>3rd Floor:<br>- King Suite 2 (Sleeps 2): King bed, Smart TV, en suite with double vanities and walk-in shower<br>- Guest Bedroom 4 (Sleeps 2): King bed, Smart TV<br>- Guest Bedroom 5 (Sleeps 2): Queen bed, Smart TV<br>- Shared Bathroom: Vanity and tub/shower combo<br>- Additional Sleeping: Queen sleeper sofa included<br><br>Amenities & Features<br>- Private Pool & Spa (optional heating Oct–Apr)<br>- Two Balconies with luxury seating<br>- Outdoor Grill & Bluetooth Speaker<br>- 1-Minute Walk to Dune Allen Beach<br>- 6-Seater Golf Cart<br>- 6 Beach Chairs + 2 Beach Umbrellas<br>- Complimentary use of Paddleboard, Surfboard and Inflatable Boat with Paddle<br><br>Important Things to Know<br>- Parking: Up to 4 cars available on property<br>- Beach Access: Public Dune Allen Beach – 1-minute walk with parking & services<br>- Pool & Spa: Private pool and spa; optional heating available Oct–Apr ($70 per night)<br>- Golf Cart: 6-seater golf cart included<br>- Beach Gear: 6 beach chairs, 2 umbrellas, 17 beach towels, paddleboard, surfboard, inflatable boat with paddle<br>- Baby Gear: Crib, Pack n' Play, and high chair available for rental, contact Live The Gulf Coast.<br>- Pets: Allowed - $250 per pet, non-refundable. Maximum 2 pets allowed. Must be under 60lbs. Breed restrictions apply. No cats.<br><br>RESTRICTED BREEDS: Akita, Australian Blue Heeler, Boxer, Bull Mastiffs, Chow, Dalmatian, Doberman, English Bulldog, German Shepherd, Great Dane, Husky (any type), Malamute, Mastiff (any variation), Pit Bulls, Presa Canarios, Rottweiler, Saint Bernard, Wolf-dog Hybrid<br><br>- Check-in: 4:00 PM<br>- Check-out: 10:00 AM<br>- Events: Not permitted unless pre-approved<br>- Age Requirement: Minimum age of 25 for non-family groups<br>- Cancellation Policy: No refunds<br>- Mid-stay Clean Fee: Applies to reservations of 21+ days<br><br>For bike rentals, baby gear, beach services, bonfires, excursions, pool heat, and concierge experiences, please contact Live the Gulf Coast.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Large Family Getaway – Pool, Golf Cart, Sleeps 17"
        }
      ],
